WEBVTT

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:52.240
Thank you, everyone!

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.630
Thank you so, so much!

00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:00.800
I'm the happiest girl in the world right now!

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:04.950
You're the cutest girl in the universe!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.220
Yuka-tan!

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.530
Yuka-tan!

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:27.010
There's someone I'd like you to meet today.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:42.640
This is the person who will make me the happiest girl in the universe.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:55.650
I lo—

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.860
I love you...

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.250
Figures.

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:20.970
Unbelievable.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.860
Oversleepin' on account of dreamin' of idols.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:25.850
Ain't you got nothin' better to live for?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.180
I concur.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.770
Obcephive Love Story

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.200
Minori's statement is most astute.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.440
And besides, Kousaku,

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:35.330
you're always flappin' yer gums about goin' to Tokyo,

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:36.940
but whadya reckon
you'll even do there?

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.650
Trendy agriculture!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:42.220
Trendy agriculture?!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:56.070
A hick like you'd do better to get
hitched with some hometown gal

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:59.520
and farm yer days away in the sticks.

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:00.960
Sounds like Purgatory!

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:04.640
I'm gonna do trendy
agriculture with Yuka-tan!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.620
We'll plant rice in Harajuku,

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.750
and raise cattle in ol' Roppongi!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.630
And please, a hometown gal?

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:15.150
You're the only one my age!

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.860
G-Golly, am I?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.030
It done slipped my mind.

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.050
Kousaku, Minori.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:24.520
Enough with the tomfoolery.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.120
Focus on your work.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.970
Ah, sorry.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:28.980
Numskull.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:31.660
You done got us bawled out by Kei.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.160
It wasn't <i>my</i> fault!

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.000
It's loose!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.100
A cow's escaped from the barn!

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.420
Sensei, watch out!

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:42.050
It got Mutsu-sensei from Husbandry!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.130
Medic!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.380
SS Ageha!

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:46.760
<i>Another</i> one got out?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.960
Last time was a peacock, warn't it?

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.390
It was the goat, Jun.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.850
You're thinking of the time before last.

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:56.860
All right, y'all. Let's get back to work.

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.020
'Kay.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:01.400
Wait.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.420
It's coming this way.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:03.280
Seriously?!

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.760
Don't let it in the fields!

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:10.580
Easy for you to say!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.320
Lemme at him!

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.020
Kakizaki's going for it!

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:17.670
A national-level competitor
like him should...

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:21.380
K-Kakizaki!

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:24.860
Are the Husbandry guys raising beef cattle or demons?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.390
Dude! Wh-What do we do?!

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.600
Wave this and run.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:48.490
What am I, a matador?!

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:52.280
Olé! Olé, goddamn it!

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:00.960
FML...

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:09.970
You're the only one who cares about me, Young Master!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:10.930
Kousaku.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:13.980
Did you bring in your
career aspirations survey?

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:15.880
Yeah.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.270
You're continuing your studies, I assume?

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:23.520
I'm still weighing my options, but I've been looking at agricultural colleges.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.100
You've sure got it together.

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:31.990
Hell, I'm only here 'cause
my parents are farmers.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.840
In that case, what is your plan?

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:34.950
Higher education, like you!

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:38.880
Higher education?

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:39.910
That's what I said.

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:43.000
Y-You warn't serious about
that "trendy" stuff, were you?

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:47.640
My dream school is none other

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.640
than Furikoshi Academy Private High School!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:07:00.200
Writing a high school on a high school's career survey is novel, to say the least.

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:02.320
Don't look now, but there's
an idiot in the room.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:03.620
Hey!

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.770
What's with that pitying look?!

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:07.480
Kousaku,

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:11.150
you must really love
that idol of yours.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.320
She's not "that idol"!
She's Kusakabe Yuka-tan!

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:16.790
So what about her appeals to you?

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:19.080
Her big, round eyes are cute.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.410
Her petite, slightly pouty lips are cute.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.350
Her plump, apple-red cheeks are cute.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:25.120
Her girlish voice is cute.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.950
Her natural hairstyle is cute.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:28.920
Her quizzical eyebrows are cute.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.740
Very well. I get the picture.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:31.490
No you don't.

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:32.370
I'm not finished.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.340
Yuka-tan's carefree smile is cute.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:35.720
Her aura of refinement is cute—

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:36.720
Numskull!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.520
You ain't in dreamland no more!

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:40.890
You gotta think this through proper-like!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.920
Well, did you bring <i>yours</i>?

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.400
Higher education? Employment?

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:53.860
W-Well, employment, I s'pose.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.340
Office work?

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:00.200
N-Now wait one gosh... darned...

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:06.440
Well, they're all <i>technically</i> careers.

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:08.380
Don't look now, but there's
an idiot in the room!

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:11.030
I-I ain't no idiot!

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.340
It's a full-time job!

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.010
Cut the noise pollution,

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:16.800
you plebians!

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.800
There she is! Tits!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.610
Wh-Who are you calling Tits?!

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:23.450
My name is Kochou! Yoshida Kochou!

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.860
The dunces of the Cultivation program, I see.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.900
Indulging in your inane chatter as usual.

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:33.770
Even within the Manufacturing Science Department,

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:37.330
you crop-huggers are in the
inconsequential Cultivation program.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.420
<i>I</i> am of the elite Animal
Husbandry program.

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:42.080
You're dirt beneath my feet.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:48.150
Yet you carry on with your frivolities
with no regard for the nuisance you cause.

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:49.750
Common courtesy is a lost art.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.870
Mighty funny from a gal
who brings a cow to class!

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.760
Silence, pleb!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.770
SS Ageha is no average heifer.

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:04.390
She's the finest grade Hida cattle,
destined to become elite <i>wagyu</i>!

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.990
Shyeah, like 100 grams for 30 yen—

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:13.190
Ageha is expected to sell for 16 million yen.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.450
Okay, youse bumpkins, make way, ya see?

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:21.070
Whose side are you on?!

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.830
I'm sorry! Seriously, I'm sorry!

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:26.480
Infighting, are we?

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.830
A fitting prelude to your
ultimate demise, plebs.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:31.590
Yoshida.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:35.830
Wh-What ish it, you p-p-pweb?

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:38.130
T-T-Twink twice befwore
addweshing me wike dat!

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.370
Cattle are sensitive creatures.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:44.720
They're naturally prone to panicking in the presence of humans.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:49.210
I question the wisdom of bringing one to a place so noisy and full of fools.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.080
How naïve of you, Kamatori Kei.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:55.280
Whatever your pretentions, you're no more than a pleb!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.210
What... did you say?!

00:09:58.050 --> 00:09:59.830
This morning's incident

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.420
made it abundantly clear that
Ageha is still mentally immature.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:05.450
Thus, I'm desensitizing
her to human contact.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.830
Desensitizing?!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.950
So <i>that</i> explains it.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.090
I shouldn't have doubted you, Yoshida.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:17.940
It was not my place to question your passion and expertise for animal husbandry.

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:21.310
I-I hwope you wearned your wesshon!

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:25.430
I-It would behwoove you not to
twalk back to me in the fushure!

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.250
Y-You pwebwean!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.190
Good morning, class!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.190
The sun is shining and it feels lovely!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.530
Your teacher Becky is so happy!

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.320
She'd be even <i>happier</i> if she had a hubby to financially support her!

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:44.450
Sensei!

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.370
Yes, Nakazawa-san?

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.930
You want to tell Becky how cute she looks?

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.210
Oh, you tease! Becky's in her forties, you know!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.000
Tits—

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:58.010
Yoshida-san has brought a cow to class!

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.910
Oh, that she has.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:05.970
Why have you brought a cow, Yoshida-san?

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.270
Ma'am.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:11.570
As Mutsu-sensei the Husbandry teacher was incapacitated this morning,

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:13.960
I have taken it upon
myself to look after her.

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:15.730
Wow! That's not the
explanation <i>we</i> heard!

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:19.660
Yoshida-san, are you sure you can handle her?

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:21.030
Do I look stupid?

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:22.960
Then it's a-ok!

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.450
N-Now hold up, Sensei!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.580
That ain't right!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.450
If'n <i>that's</i> fine and dandy,

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:33.020
then we oughta be 'llowed to bring our planters to class.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:34.200
Right, y'all?

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:35.110
She's right!

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:36.340
Why's husbandry so special?

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.600
Not to mention, you guys are always eating up the budget!

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:42.860
Says the ones always gobbling up fruits and veggies in the name of "taste analysis"!

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.380
Where are <i>our</i> melons?

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:45.600
Melons, I say!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.600
Don't be so rough with each other!

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.150
Both you, Nakazawa-san, and Yoshida-san.

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:53.350
Let's have a pleasurable time together!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.080
But looky here, Sensei!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.950
This is crazy any which way you cut it!

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:59.150
Crazy in what way, pleb?

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.230
Feed us!

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.530
Go to Hell, Tits!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.600
That's right!

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.660
Speaking of crazy,

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:08.910
last night your teacher
went to a family restaurant,

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:12.060
ordered some wine since
she doesn't eat out often,

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:15.410
asked for two glasses, one for him,

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:20.040
made a toast, complimented the wine, said, "Gosh, I might be getting tipsy,"

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:22.160
giggled slightly...

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:26.650
Crazy, isn't it?

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:29.350
I don't even have a boyfriend.

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:36.190
Okay, time for class!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.650
Time to eat!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.620
Delish!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.350
Refill please!

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:54.500
Right away.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.120
Eat up.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:01.550
Thanks for the food!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:06.030
Man, that was good!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:11.300
Earlier, the prime minister and two cabinet members

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.750
held a press conference on the bill to raise taxes.

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:15.010
However, the opposition...

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:16.390
<i>Delicious.</i>

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:17.730
<i>Truly delicious.</i>

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:20.370
<i>Man needs only a steady
caloric intake to survive,</i>

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:23.030
<i>so why do we seek taste?</i>

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.980
<i>Why did God make man this way?</i>

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:28.740
<i>But wait, might God not exist?</i>

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.870
<i>Nay!</i>

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.960
<i>There is a God!</i>

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:36.880
<i>For 'twas God who bestowed Yuka-tan unto me!</i>

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:37.690
Kousaku.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:40.140
<i>No. In fact, it is Yuka-tan who is divine.</i>

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.840
<i>Kusakabe Yuka is God!</i>

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.930
Hey, Kousaku!

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:44.850
<i>All Japanese men who do not worship Yuka-tan</i>

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:46.800
<i>should commit harakiri at once!</i>

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.800
Wouldja listen, Kousaku?

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:49.980
What's your problem?

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.570
I was just engaged in deep contem—

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.110
Quit yappin' and mind the TV!

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.890
Something major's going down.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.270
Sheesh, what's got you two worked—

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.480
Kusakabe Yuka's shocking retirement!

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:02.880
God is dead!

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:05.940
No way!

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:08.910
<i>This can't be.</i>

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:09.600
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:11.620
<i>It can't, it can't, it can't!</i>

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:15.250
<i>You're the cutest in the universe!</i>

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.990
Class is startin'!

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.780
Git yer rear out here!

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:31.260
It's time to face reality.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.380
Kei, hand me the master key.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:40.980
I ain't waitin' no more for you to open up!

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.450
Stupid Kousaku.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:44.780
You're a right handful, you—

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.060
Wh-What in tarnation?!

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:54.510
A body pillow cover?

00:14:57.650 --> 00:15:00.880
I ain't never met a body what actually had one of these.

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:05.380
Didja honestly sleep in nothin' but them boxers and that pillowcase?

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.080
I think you might need help.

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.270
Yuka-tan and I are one and the same.

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.820
I am Yuka-tan! Yuka-tan is I!

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:15.010
Not only has the shock made him flee reality,

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:18.720
it seems he's trying to merge identities with her as a defense mechanism.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:21.480
A remarkable show of Instrumentality.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:21.940
Blast it!

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:23.450
You rabid creep!

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:25.980
Shed that thing and git to the fields!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:33.870
They'll kick you out if'n you play hooky.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:37.010
You can kiss good-bye to that "trendy agriculture".

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:39.330
I don't care anymore.

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:45.060
I only raised crops so I could
send them to Yuka-tan.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:49.390
Kibou 209, bound for Shin-osaka,

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.930
will be departing from platform 14.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.930
To send to her?

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.720
Let me get this straight.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:58.930
You've been sending the vegetables
you grew in class to Kusakabe Yuka?

00:15:58.930 --> 00:15:59.660
Yeah.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.890
Like the plump, black eggplants
we grew in our greenhouse class.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:04.140
Sexual terrorism?

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:05.520
Yeah, I reckon that's a felony.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:07.890
Huh? Why?

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:12.180
You anonymously mailed a young gal
a box full of eggplants?

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.030
Are you loony?

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.010
B-But she lives in Tokyo!

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:17.780
A concrete jungle where the diet rarely contains enough veggies!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.750
I thought they might help her perk up!

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:25.330
I certainly see where you're coming from.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:29.160
Thanks, Kei. I knew my
best bud would understand.

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:31.660
So what else did you send her?

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:33.260
Fresh, bumpy cucumbers.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.610
Call the cops! We got a sex offender!

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:36.640
Gee thanks, best bud!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:37.830
Make haste, Minori!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:40.890
If we don't apprehend him quickly, we'll be tried as accomplices!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.370
Wait! Stop! Listen!

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:44.060
I sent her a bunch of other stuff too!

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.500
Like sweet corn and bitter melon!

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.860
Or the matsutake mushrooms
I bummed off the Forestry guys!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:48.950
I was thinking white rad—

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:49.890
No more!

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:51.230
Don't compound your crime!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:55.570
I got half a mind you
were doin' this on purpose.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:56.750
What do you mean?

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:59.180
What did I do wrong anyway? Sheesh!

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:01.320
Exist?

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.120
That bad?!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:08.120
Fine, then. Explain to me what I did wrong.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.940
Clearly. And in detail.

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:13.320
H-Huh? Now what're you goin' on—

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:14.460
It's simple!

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:18.550
Tell me what the problem was with
sending her eggplants and cucumbers!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:22.300
Th-The eggplants ain't the problem.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.270
I-It's just...

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:29.770
I ain't so sure 'bout sendin' them anonymously to a young gal...

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:30.750
That's not what you said!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.220
You said the eggplants
were the problem!

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:33.620
You dissed the eggplants!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:37.370
How would you feel if I
insulted the crops <i>you</i> grew?

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:38.530
What did I do wrong?

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:43.880
Well it's just... they got a dirty shape...

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:48.060
Oh? Eggplants have a dirty shape, do they?

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:50.420
Dirty how and why?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:53.500
Spell it out so a dummy like me can get it.

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:56.980
Y-You know, they look like <i>that.</i>

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:00.680
Oh-hoh?

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:04.560
So what does the sight of girthy, black, glistening eggplants

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:07.720
remind <i>you</i> of, Minori?

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:11.090
Come now, let's hear you say it.

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:14.860
A p... p...

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:18.550
pe... pen...

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:21.700
Like hell I'll say it, asshole!

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.910
You knew full well, didn't you?

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:26.850
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.910
I'm not actually that slow.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:34.890
Well, I don't reckon she 'et any,

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:36.880
but didja hear back at least?

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:48.000
Of course not.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.270
Why's that?

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:52.160
You never know with these things.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:53.650
I sent them anonymously.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.840
What are you, some cobbler's elf?

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:57.570
Or perhaps a daddy-long-legs.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.290
Anyhow,

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:02.070
Kusakabe Yuka's retirin' is her business.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.900
You just worry 'bout gettin' to class

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:05.900
before the lot of us get a hidin'.

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:08.460
I said, I'm not going!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:09.710
I'm gonna stay here,

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:12.780
together with Yuka-tan forever!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:15.450
Yuka-tan is so beautiful, so cute,

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.130
so kind, so pure...

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:23.390
Sure, I bet that gal's a slut.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:24.850
Why you...

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.940
You shut your bitch mouth, Thunder Thighs!

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.350
You dirty rotten piece of...

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.440
<i>Announcing my withdrawal
from the gene pool.</i>

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:36.230
Now listen you here, Kousaku.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:39.900
Skippin' when you're on duty ain't nothin' but trouble for the rest of us!

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:44.670
Keep it up, and I'll ask them
Husbandry folks to neuter you for real!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:45.770
Got it?

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.310
If you got it, say so!

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.120
Can't.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:11.060
This sucks! There's no point anymore!

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.520
Quit bellyachin' and do yer work.

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:16.590
Kei, help me out here.

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:18.440
Huh? Right...

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.990
Morning, class!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.370
Say, listen to this!

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:25.830
You see, this morning,

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:29.910
your dear teacher tried on some of that
wicked-expensive essential oil she bought!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:33.140
And, oh my <i>God</i>, it was just, <i>so</i> good.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:35.570
Her rough skin turned silky smooth!

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:39.800
So then your teacher thought, why not do her whole body?

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.100
And, figuring any oil would do, she <i>slathered</i> it on!

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:45.660
Cooking oil! All over her body! With a dash of chili oil!

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:48.470
And oh! So smooth and glistening!

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.720
Like a baby's bottom? No, like sushi!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.220
Like, slice me up and serve me with ginger!

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:54.650
She started snapping selfies like crazy!

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:56.080
Struck a pose! Let it all out!

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.270
Playboy, here I come!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.770
And then! And then...

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:02.780
I wanted to die.

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:06.670
Because really, I was just some oily freak.

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:08.000
It was even in my hair.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:11.120
And when I looked
through my memory card,

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:14.340
there I was, looking smug,
spread like a camwhore.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.380
Oh yeah. We have a transfer student.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:22.000
A transfer student?

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:24.610
Yep. She's a major cutie too.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:27.010
Okay, Kinoshita-san. Come in!

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:48.590
<i>To call so fair a maiden "a high schooler" would be a grave injustice.</i>

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:52.920
<i>Far too darling, exquisite, delicate, and awe-inspiring was she.</i>

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:55.410
<i>Before me stood the epitome of an idol.</i>

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:57.750
Yuka... tan?

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:01.460
My name is Kinoshita Ringo.

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:39.300
"King of Farmers".
